    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 纏"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">纏</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 李鈺凰</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjVdpe0ZXa9QnfAcblVSsP0bhMhI47xK39YJhLhFk95bNufJPk5nR2N18Jh36_Kxu1H4mXtbrEPW6m3JDT-XvMEMpgLk-sflLfPH-zLetN4xSafEojEPOV5HZhnugFz0KKYyIVEBlbBtxnOxrGLzrFDy0YP1Cwwl5DqTQ60uuM25C35WLC5v-0ae92VAAB1\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\">\n        城市雙樓孤青影<br />喙角一絲前兩冬<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>無變，bat tam--過ê清花芳<br />幼瓣薄薄sio貼<br />摻有因無果ê木質芳<br />Bak著<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>枕頭、tsíng甲、你ê頭鬃<br /><br />Kha-tsiah規phiàn沙場ê紅星一點一點<br />紅跡用藤sut，tín動<br />手pôo sio疊<br />Ná膨皮燒pháng<br />Tsíng頭仔sio勾，咬--lueh<br />你ê面容漸漸仔罩霧<br />——散做輕聲<br />留hōo我無飽流<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>賰瀾ê溫柔\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg-AcDPaO29nBtpX-fusYc5WRSX4T4j2RFh_Cv13C47q5n9E4O3kS0DRor4JBtqVHIe6qiJJXveaG6dXwSUSimgsbzS7iChemdGhHaJy6LLxfRBjX7dil-iImPkml0R0GSm_0Ive3_V1t9t6eWGC_59AGGaQzLWQO3d7uvLZYeKKwF_9RpLCnH-jC0QET5r\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 385期，2026年04月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
